{"id":"n15093-1-2","stage":3,"title":"어찌나 · 太","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15093-1-2-1","ko":"날씨가 어찌나 더운지 아무것도 못하겠어.","zh":"天气热得要命，根本什么都做不了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어찌나","meaning":"太，过分地","explanation":"어찌나：太，过分地","readings":[{"term":"어찌나","audio":"/audio/2ec28fbd146036c935fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15093","senseId":"1","lemma":"어찌나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더운지","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무것도","meaning":"啥，什么","explanation":"아무것：啥，什么；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아무것","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58274","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하겠어.","meaning":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","explanation":"못하다：做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"2ec28fbd146036c9","term":"어찌나","zh":"太，过分地","audio":"/audio/2ec28fbd146036c935fc.mp3","entryId":"15093","definition":"(强调)强度或程度格外地。","pronunciation":["어찌나"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"5e19fcc44c943145","term":"아무것","zh":"啥，什么","audio":"/audio/5e19fcc44c9431450d98.mp3","entryId":"58274","definition":"表示不确定的某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무걷"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做不了、没能做（本句所说的动作未能实现）","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f82e140cb02f8ab1f9f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15093-1-2-2","ko":"나도 그래. 매일 섭씨 삼십 도를 웃도니 잠도 못 자겠어.","zh":"我也是。每天气温都超过三十摄氏度，根本睡不着觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"섭씨","meaning":"摄氏","explanation":"섭씨：摄氏","readings":[{"term":"섭씨","audio":"/audio/9d090db838096a8a0c41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63017","senseId":"1","lemma":"섭씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼십","meaning":"三十","explanation":"삼십：三十","readings":[{"term":"삼십","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61994","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도를","meaning":"度","explanation":"도：度；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"도","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47500","senseId":"1","lemma":"도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웃도니","meaning":"高于，多于","explanation":"웃돌다：高于，多于；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"웃돌다","audio":"/audio/77232cab1b65e2ae3c55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71437","senseId":"1","lemma":"웃돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠도","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자겠어.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"9d090db838096a8a","term":"섭씨","zh":"摄氏","audio":"/audio/9d090db838096a8a0c41.mp3","entryId":"63017","definition":"将水结冰的温度设为0度，水沸腾的温度设为100度，并将此范围进行100等分后用来测量温度的单位。","pronunciation":["섭씨"]},{"id":"ad3bcec25d1da981","term":"삼십","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/ad3bcec25d1da981651f.mp3","entryId":"61994","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["삼십"]},{"id":"a3ec07cdd87ae1fa","term":"도","zh":"度","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3","entryId":"47500","definition":"温度单位。","pronunciation":["도ː"]},{"id":"77232cab1b65e2ae","term":"웃돌다","zh":"高于，多于","audio":"/audio/77232cab1b65e2ae3c55.mp3","entryId":"71437","definition":"超过某个程度。","pronunciation":["욷똘다"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/798211131926564b821a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15093","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7804,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也是。每天气温都超过三十摄氏度，根本睡不着觉。","照片里的你哥哥看起来个子很高呢。","天气热得要命，根本什么都做不了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我也是。每天气温都超过三十摄氏度，根本睡不着觉。","天气热得要命，根本什么都做不了。","照片里的你哥哥看起来个子很高呢。"],"answer":0}]}
